# PowerPC `rlwinm` with a wrapping mask: the manual contradicts itself. Which reading is right?

VERDICT line first, then the liveness token `CODEX_RLWDISPUTE_20260910`.

## READ ONLY THESE FILES. DO NOT LIST OR SEARCH DIRECTORIES.

