C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\_scratchpad\ppc_pem32_rev2_2001.txt:7584:The contents of rS are rotated left by the number of bits specified by operand in the low-order five bits of rB. A mask is generated having 1 bits from the bit specified by operand MB through the bit specified by operand ME and 0 bits elsewhere. The rotated word is ANDed with the generated mask and the result is placed into rA. rlwnm Rotate Left Word then AND with Mask rlwnm. Rotate Left Word then AND with Mask with CR Update.
