10273:The instructions listed in Table 4-38 provide access to the segment registers for 32-bit implementations. These instructions operate completely independently of the MSR[IR] and MSR[DR] bit settings. Refer to Section 2.3.17, "Synchronization Requirements for Special Registers and for Lookaside Buffers," for serialization requirements and other recommended precautions to observe when manipulating the segment registers.
