1490: 1.1.1 The 64-Bit Architecture and the 32-Bit Subset
1491: It is important to distinguish the following modes of operations: ? 64-bit implementations/64-bit mode--The architecture provides 64-bit addressing, 64-bit integer data types, and instructions that perform arithmetic operations on
1492: 
